            <div xml:id="d972">

                <pb facs="0922" n="910" sameAs="frus:frus1943v04/pg910"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">890F.24/67: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister Resident in Saudi Arabia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Moose</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Jidda</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1943-11-08T22:00:00+03:06">November 8,
                            1943—10 p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received 11 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>175. Following telegram has been sent to the Legation at Cairo.</p>
                <p>152, November 8, 9 p.m. Following for General Royce. In reply to your telegram
                    154, November 6, 4 p.m.: “The King has indicated that he will be pleased to
                    receive you and Military Mission in Jidda December 12.”</p>
                <p>Repeated to Department.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Moose</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
